<p>Using small engines to augment your reflexes you are able to automatically fire retaliatory shots at your foes doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">89%, 109%, 125%, 138%, 150%</acronym> weapon damage.</p><p>Retaliation shots are fired when you evade/are missed by a melee or ranged attack.</p><p>This can only happen once per turn and uses shots as normal.</p>